      "t": "Out in the kitchen, Chef Barinov shocks the line cooks by calmly praising their food instead of shouting at them. Meanwhile by the bar, Kristina complains that she just needs a real man while Sasha asks what is going on between her and Max.",
      "gap": 0.8
